<title>JAPAN: Biken Techno to issue 20 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>Biken Techno to issue 20 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Biken Techno Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   20 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 27.Mar.01</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> EXER FROM 10.Apr.97  EXER TO 20.Mar.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 27.Mar.97  INT PAY 27.Mar</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 14.Mar.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price and currency rate will be decided on March 13 and the coupon on March 14.</p>
</text>
